# autonomous-company-simulator needs NO credentials, API keys, or secrets to
# run: locally, in CI, or deployed. The engine (lib/, from M1 on) is designed
# to be deterministic, framework-free, and to read no external service: no
# cryptography, no LLM, no network (.genesis/PLAN.md decisions D5 and D10).
# At genesis there is no engine code at all yet.
#
# The one environment variable the deployed app will read is set FOR you by
# Vercel; you never configure it yourself, and local dev works without it:
#
#   VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA   The SHA of the commit Vercel deployed. It will be
#                           read by app/api/health/route.ts (milestone M2,
#                           NOT BUILT YET) to report which commit is live.
#                           Unset during `npm run dev`; the health check is
#                           specified to fall back to "unknown (local dev)"
#                           rather than invent a SHA.
#
# There is nothing to fill in below. If a later milestone introduces a real
# credential, it gets documented here with what it is for when that happens,
# not invented ahead of time.
